/ A program's "before each goal" hears its app's own goals, never plang's system goals: while it is bound, the app's goal
/ Mine runs and then plang's /system/shortcut/Goal is called, and the call bound before each goal heard Mine last.
Start
- before each goal, call Log
- call goal Mine
- call goal /system/shortcut/Goal
- assert %last% equals "Mine"

Mine
- set %x% = 1

Log
- set %last% = %!event!item.name%
